1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,540
The treatment left its mark on me

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:07,300
In my hands and in my feet

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:11,140
Tried acupuncture and the shock pads

4
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:14,580
And it still won't go to sleep

5
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:18,420
I can't feel the floor beneath me

6
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:21,620
But I sure can feel the pain

7
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:25,540
Never know where my next step lands

8
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:28,900
But I take it just the same

9
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:32,500
So I gotta be ten times stronger

10
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:36,340
'Cause I'm ten times weak

11
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:39,700
And every step I take on faith

12
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:42,580
Is a word that I keep

13
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:46,980
It's been years since that screen door

14
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:49,940
Since the lawn and the grin

15
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:54,020
Now we're done with zoo visits

16
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:57,460
'Cause you're welcome to come in
